data.definition:
The LGN/STN route comparison (RULES.txt in this folder) as a paper record, from the saved results only:
    python labels/bfroute_s9_2026-11-15/bfroute_numbers.py s11      -> paper/numbers/lgnstn_bfroute_s11.json
    python labels/bfroute_s9_2026-11-15/bfroute_numbers.py s12 --dry  (prints; writes nothing)
Schema: out_<tag>/results.json's (checks, summary, rows, table, table_composites, fields), plus
  routes: MRI = the MRI route of record (bf-native -> b0 (R1) -> MRI template (R5)); R8 = the blockface route with step 8 only;
          R9 = the blockface route with the step-9 template (d2bs8_s5sym link, step-9 field, step-8 member warp, native map);
  members: which of MM1-MM3 built the template's image (in S11/S12) and which are outside it;
  definition: this docstring and RULES.txt's text.
